var text2 = "Each rod has a decimal place value &mdash; 1s, 10s, 100s, etc. &mdash; from right to left. Every upper bead moved down adds 5 times the rod's place value; every lower bead moved up adds 1 times the rod's place value."
var text3 = "Any decimal number can be represented using only one upper bead and four lower beads on each rod. However, some methods to multiply or divide decimal numbers use the extra beads for increased speed and accuracy."

